    "Customer": "Customer",
    "Kalau ada orang yang bilang tempat ini kemahalan, gila si... soalnya dari segi harga dari segi kenyamanan semua itu ada lhoo. Enak deh pokoknya tidur disini gak bakal kapok.": "If someone says this place is too expensive, they're crazy... because in terms of price and comfort, everything is there. Sleeping here is so nice, you won't regret it.",
    "Tempatnya bersih, aman, dan pemiliknya ramah banget. Fasilitas lengkap, cocok buat yang butuh tempat tinggal nyaman di area kampus. Recommended pokoknya!": "The place is clean, safe, and the owner is very friendly. Complete facilities, perfect for those who need a comfortable place to live near campus. Highly recommended!",
    "Sewa fleksibelnya bikin gampang banget. Tinggal sesuai kebutuhan, harganya bersahabat, dan lokasinya strategis. Bakal balik lagi kalau ke Batu.": "The flexible rental makes it so easy. Just pick according to your needs, the price is friendly, and the location is strategic. Will definitely come back when visiting Batu.",

